<view class="page">
  <view class="header">
    <view class="header-icon">🤖</view>
    <text class="header-title">AI 助手</text>
    <text class="header-desc">AI 帮你整理文本、识别图片、转写语音</text>
    <view class="header-status" wx:if="{{isMember}}">
      <t-tag theme="success" variant="light" size="small">已开通 · 有效期至 {{memberExpiry}}</t-tag>
    </view>
    <view class="header-status" wx:else>
      <t-tag theme="warning" variant="light" size="small">未开通</t-tag>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="section-label">AI 能力</view>
  <view class="feature-list">
    <view
      wx:for="{{features}}"
      wx:key="key"
      class="feature-item"
      data-key="{{item.key}}"
      data-path="{{item.path}}"
      bindtap="goFeature"
    >
      <view class="feature-icon">{{item.icon}}</view>
      <view class="feature-body">
        <text class="feature-title">{{item.title}}</text>
        <text class="feature-desc">{{item.desc}}</text>
      </view>
      <text class="feature-arrow">›</text>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view wx:if="{{!isMember}}" class="upgrade-card">
    <view class="upgrade-title">如何升级 AI 助手？</view>
    <view class="upgrade-desc">
      AI 助手为增值服务。请联系客服咨询开通事宜，并说明您的硬件序列号。
    </view>
    <t-button theme="primary" block bind:tap="contactService">联系客服</t-button>
  </view>

  <view wx:else class="tips-card">
    <view class="tips-title">💡 使用提示</view>
    <view class="tips-desc">
      连接硬件后可解锁更多专业模板（办公、写作、学习等场景）。
      未连接硬件时仅可使用通用模板。
    </view>
  </view>
</view>
